    title: "Two cmd_symbols render tests are non-hermetic: fail under ambient FORCE_COLOR (Rich ANSI codes split the asserted substring)"  # f55c
    status: todo_hard  # f55c
    priority: 3  # f55c
    parent:  # f55c
